<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 371 0 R/Alt(Two panels of dot plots, one row per law, showing how many runs on the held-out four-shaker structures pass. Each row has three markers: a filled blue circle for all seven criteria, an open orange square for reading A (ends at full level inside 3 dB) and an open green triangle for reading B (never 3 dB over the full-level target). (a) Realistic tier, of 6 runs: frozen law 5, 6, 5; followed family 4, 6, 4; hold rule 5, 6, 5; coupled corrector 5, 6, 5; physics model 2, 2, 5; network as the law's model 4, 4, 5; network setting the ceiling 4, 6, 4. (b) Stress tier, of 10 runs: frozen law 2, 5, 2; followed family 5, 7, 7; hold rule 6, 6, 6; coupled corrector 5, 5, 10; physics model 1, 1, 10; network as the law's model 2, 6, 5; network setting the ceiling 4, 6, 5.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[13]/Pg 781 0 R>>
endobj
