458 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 459 0 R/Alt(Three panels against measurement noise of 0, 1e-3, 3e-3 and 1e-2. Blue solid line with circles: the hold rule as it is. Orange dashed line with squares: each probe averaged 16 times (not run at zero noise). Green dotted line with triangles: the climb in 6 dB steps, unchecked. (a) Passes of 160 under all seven criteria: hold rule 160, 159, 158, 139; averaged probes 160, 158, 134; climb 120, 120, 125, 127. (b) Passes of 160 by reading A, ending at full level inside 3 dB: hold rule 160, 159, 160, 155; averaged probes 160, 160, 158; climb 160 at every noise level. (c) Passes of 40 on the realistic tier under all seven criteria: hold rule 40, 40, 39, 33; averaged probes 40, 39, 24; climb 40 at every noise level.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[27]/Pg 785 0 R>>
endobj
